<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>R20 双侧接点互锁与公差检查（概念模型）</title><style>
:root{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Noto Sans CJK SC",sans-serif;color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#0d1726;color:#e7eff7}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:28px 24px}.head{border-bottom:1px solid #3d5066;padding-bottom:22px}h1{font-size:27px;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:17px;margin:14px 0}p{color:#adc0d5;line-height:1.65}small{color:#95aec6}section{border:1px solid #2d425b;background:#152337;border-radius:12px;margin:18px 0;padding:18px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;gap:16px}.control{margin-bottom:16px}label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px}input[type="range"]{width:100%}select{width:100%;color:#edf2fa;background:#243750;border:1px solid #46617a;padding:10px;border-radius:6px}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}.row input{accent-color:#65b2d0}#plot{background:#f5f8fb;border-radius:8px;width:100%;aspect-ratio:2.3}strong{color:#fff}.status{padding:13px;border-radius:8px;background:#223b50;border:1px solid #416b86;line-height:1.7}.bad{border-color:#e46a73;color:#ffd2d5}.good{border-color:#3a9e7d;color:#c7f7e2}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}td,th{border-bottom:1px solid #2d425b;text-align:left;padding:9px 8px}th{color:#b6c8d6}code{color:#afe4d7}@media(max-width:800px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding:15px}}</style></head><body><main><div class="head"><h1>R20｜双端接点仓 - 局部实体阻挡与公差</h1><p>RAZR 60 Ultra 双等尺寸功能舱候选。此查看器与 STEP 共用名义尺寸，但仅显示局部 X-Z 代理剖面，<strong>不是完整机构CAD或实际自动解锁证明。</strong></p></div>
<div class="layout"><section><h2>可交互状态</h2><div class="control"><label for="phase">主运动阶段</label><select id="phase"><option value="slide">滑动中（未坐实）</option><option value="seat">终点：假设两侧真实坐实</option><option value="open">展开端：假设两侧锁止</option></select></div><div class="row"><input type="checkbox" id="left"><label for="left">左挡块解除</label></div><div class="row"><input type="checkbox" id="right"><label for="right">右挡块解除</label></div><div class="row"><input type="checkbox" id="extend"><label for="extend">强制接点载体伸出（故障注入）</label></div><div class="control"><label for="err">压合面误差 ±<b id="errv">0.25</b> mm</label><input id="err" type="range" min="0" max="0.3" step="0.01" value="0.25"></div><div class="control"><label for="age">附加热漂移/磨损预算 ±<b id="agev">0.00</b> mm</label><input id="age" type="range" min="0" max="0.12" step="0.01" value="0"></div><div id="status" class="status">读取中</div></section><section><h2>局部横截面（名义 X-Z，触点高度已变形示意）</h2><svg id="plot" viewBox="-250 -70 500 215" role="img" aria-label="双侧狗齿挡块和四根触点局部剖视"><g id="geom"></g><g font-size="12" fill="#426075"><text x="-230" y="129">−25 mm ← X → +25 mm（比例×10）</text><text x="-230" y="-48">TE 2199001-1：橙色载体耳 / 红色挡块 / 蓝色信号接点</text></g></svg><h2>本轮实际几何约束</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>项</th><th>允许/当前</th></tr><tr><td>TE工作高度</td><td>0.70 – 1.00 mm（厂家）</td></tr><tr><td>采用名义高度</td><td>0.85 mm（候选）</td></tr><tr><td>未压高度</td><td>1.20 mm（厂家）</td></tr><tr><td>载体缩回行程</td><td>0.80 mm（候选）</td></tr><tr><td>单侧阻挡交集</td><td>强制伸出时约0.180 mm³（CAD）</td></tr><tr><td>未解决</td><td>双侧共同误解锁、承力/寿命/真实端面传动</td></tr></tbody></table></section></div><section><h2>工程说明</h2><p>蓝色触点仅为经厂家外尺寸定标的矩形包络，不是TE提供的 STEP，也不模拟C形弹片的真实接触力。绿色“许可”只代表设置了两个虚拟挡块解除并假设坐实，<strong>不能证明物理上已经安全。</strong>若两挡块过早同时打开，强制接点伸出也不会被本模型额外阻拦，属已知危险反例。</p><p>基线 R19 双舱尺寸：各94.25 × 73.99 mm；B上滑79.75mm、再向前就位8.2mm。TE资料：<a href="https://www.te.com/en/product-2199001-1.html" style="color:#80c9ea">官方产品页</a>。</p></section></main><script>
const el=id=>document.getElementById(id);const NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';const P={nom:.85,free:1.2,retract:.8,contactX:[-12,-4,4,12],workingLo:.7,workingHi:1.0};
function rect(x1,x2,z1,z2,fill){let r=document.createElementNS(NS,'rect');r.setAttribute('x',x1*10);r.setAttribute('y',-z2*40-5);r.setAttribute('width',(x2-x1)*10);r.setAttribute('height',(z2-z1)*40);r.setAttribute('fill',fill);r.setAttribute('stroke','#e6eefa');r.setAttribute('stroke-width','0.7');el('geom').appendChild(r)}
function render(){el('geom').replaceChildren();const L=el('left').checked,R=el('right').checked,ext=el('extend').checked,phase=el('phase').value;const error=+el('err').value,age=+el('age').value;el('errv').textContent=error.toFixed(2);el('agev').textContent=age.toFixed(2);const zshift=ext?0:-P.retract;
for(const cx of P.contactX){rect(cx-.525,cx+.525,-P.nom+zshift,-P.nom+zshift+(ext?P.nom:P.free),'#5c7e9f');rect(cx-1.05,cx+1.05,0,.12,'#42a8bf')}
rect(-17.8,-17.2,-1.5+zshift,-1.2+zshift,'#e0a647');rect(17.2,17.8,-1.5+zshift,-1.2+zshift,'#e0a647');rect(-18.1-(L?1.4:0),-16.9-(L?1.4:0),-1.55,-1.,'#dc555f');rect(16.9+(R?1.4:0),18.1+(R?1.4:0),-1.55,-1.,'#dc555f');rect(-23.5,-20.9,-2.85,-.35,'#a3acb9');rect(20.9,23.5,-2.85,-.35,'#a3acb9');
let blockL=ext&&!L,blockR=ext&&!R;let lo=P.nom-error-age,hi=P.nom+error+age;let heightGood=lo>=P.workingLo-1e-7 && hi<=P.workingHi+1e-7;let badEarly=ext&&L&&R&&phase==='slide';let stale=ext&&phase==='seat'&&!L&&!R;let actual=ext&&L&&R&&phase==='open';let msg=[];if(blockL||blockR)msg.push(`实体阻挡：${blockL?'左 ':''}${blockR?'右 ':''}挡块与载体凸耳碰撞；强行驱动将卡死/损伤。`);else if(badEarly)msg.push('危险反例：未到端点却双侧同时误开，载体可伸出。该机构没有独立防错门槛。');else if(actual)msg.push('名义几何可接通；真实坐实与驱动联动尚未验证，不能放行。');else if(ext)msg.push('当前设置不符合正常接通顺序，仍需要实际机械止挡和复位。');else msg.push('接点缩回；正常滑动必须处于此状态。');msg.push(`工作高度 ${lo.toFixed(2)}–${hi.toFixed(2)} mm，${heightGood?'落在厂家公开范围内（仅解析）':'超出厂家高度窗口（失败）'}。`);let stat=el('status');stat.className='status '+((!heightGood||badEarly||blockL||blockR)?'bad':'good');stat.textContent=msg.join(' ')}
for(const id of ['phase','left','right','extend','err','age'])el(id).addEventListener('input',render);render();
</script></body></html>
